      "start": 676,
      "end": 725,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "His first bail application was dismissed as withdrawn on 09.12.2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 726,
      "end": 794,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "09.12.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 783,
          "end": 793
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the applicant submits that, in fact, the grounds of arrest were not communicated to the applicant in writing, and it makes a ground for bail, as laid down by the Hon'ble Supreme Court in the case of Vihaan Kumar Vs. State of Haryana and Another, 2025 SCC OnLine SC 269.\n5.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 796,
      "end": 1091,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Supreme Court",
          "label": "COURT",
